lines in three German states, apparently as part of a campaign against fossil fuels.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Gas reserves historically low ahead of winter</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2a848534ebfedb3806641e19e091a0e52376ebc2fe43820ac418a891a1c0b55f</id><updated>2026-09-08T12:57:14Z</updated><published>2026-09-08T06:31:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-gas-reserves-historically-low-ahead-of-winter/live-79153944--dc1a84dcb659.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-gas-reserves-historically-low-ahead-of-winter/live-79153944?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Gas storage operator association INES has warned that Germany's gas reserves could run out in the event of a cold winter. Meanwhile, fallout from the AfD's state election victory continues. Follow DW for the latest.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Nicaragua challenges German arms exports to Israel at ICJ</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4b9fb147b5cf7abfa1a1c6d2cd9d3e1f21fa2a9f0975d063705f3db1e5bca354</id><updated>2026-09-08T12:55:40Z</updated><published>2026-09-07T16:26:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/nicaragua-challenges-german-arms-exports-to-israel-at-icj/a-79148044--315737afbbdd.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/nicaragua-challenges-german-arms-exports-to-israel-at-icj/a-79148044?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Germany has asked the International Court of Justice to dismiss the case on jurisdiction grounds. It also said its arms exports to Israel were documented, published, and subject to more stringent checks than most.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Saxony-Anhalt: Germany wakes up to 'unsettling' AfD victory</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:33573291927fb91c2f03de780327209aa2e97d445c30a9d69c52ea931acc7d4c</id><updated>2026-09-08T12:55:40Z</updated><published>2026-09-07T16:14:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/saxony-anhalt-germany-wakes-up-to-unsettling-afd-victory/live-78754934--2d9595de9f5f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/saxony-anhalt-germany-wakes-up-to-unsettling-afd-victory/live-78754934?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The far-right Alternative for Germany (AfD) party won the Saxony-Anhalt state election but without an absolute majority in parliament. Other European nations were wrestling with the impact of the results. Follow DW.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Russia announces it is closing Germany's consulate in St. Petersburg</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4dc98c1a67a41754ff67886fadafd1d5542aa4c102bad5a14b73986ac6a59915</id><updated>2026-09-08T12:55:40Z</updated><published>2026-09-07T16:02:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/russia-announces-it-is-closing-germany-s-consulate-in-st-petersburg/a-79149908--0c758ae8cdb6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/russia-announces-it-is-closing-germany-s-consulate-in-st-petersburg/a-79149908?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The tit-for-tat reaction comes after Germany said it is shutting down Russia's consulate in Bonn and its cultural center in Berlin.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Elversberg: Bundesliga newcomers from tiny town make waves</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9e1008e513888d9b989db3dbc70cc7058483d779cfedd92bb0f166d4c67592fe</id><updated>2026-09-08T12:55:40Z</updated><published>2026-09-08T06:47:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/elversberg-bundesliga-newcomers-from-tiny-town-make-waves/a-77194483--9d72d35ebb6f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/elversberg-bundesliga-newcomers-from-tiny-town-make-waves/a-77194483?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A team from a small southwestern German town of just 7,000 inhabitants made history by sealing promotion to become the 59th club to play in the Bundesliga. Elversberg has got off to a memorable start.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>AfD wants to form a government in Saxony-Anhalt — but how?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7e6e13a2fae22a75cccd2a3151c051860c74262f3c1df9aa487bda91bff24bcf</id><updated>2026-09-08T12:57:23Z</updated><published>2026-09-07T16:09:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/can-the-afd-form-a-government-in-saxony-anhalt/a-79107331--72d013c68919.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/afd-wants-to-form-a-government-in-saxony-anhalt-but-how/a-79107331?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Following its record election success, the far-right Alternative for Germany aims to form a government. What options does it have without the absolute majority?</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Saxony-Anhalt: Digesting the AfD's landmark election win</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:016746796c2f191e1cab4af558fdbc454e3666762dc2370a7cee94cec789bbc4</id><updated>2026-09-08T12:55:40Z</updated><published>2026-09-06T21:04:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/saxony-anhalt-digesting-the-afd-s-landmark-election-win/a-79103981--03f4036eaf84.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/saxony-anhalt-digesting-the-afd-s-landmark-election-win/a-79103981?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">With well over 40% for the far-right Alternative for Germany (AfD), Saxony-Anhalt has witnessed a landmark election night. DW's reporters were on the ground.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>2026 Beethoven Festival evokes a sense of home</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0c777745376a259b01095507fe728c3ed333df3f05fffb31ca46cc771cafe938</id><updated>2026-09-08T12:55:40Z</updated><published>2026-09-04T08:05:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/2026-beethoven-festival-evokes-a-sense-of-home/a-78892997--9bbbc99c220c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/2026-beethoven-festival-evokes-a-sense-of-home/a-78892997?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The motto of this year's classical music festival in Bonn is "Home/At Home," featuring musicians from diverse cultures presenting pieces from their homelands.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>This extremely successful author polarizes German readers</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4765e6e6fad7586d29435c2658a2374d09b1ecddc0a542b7f9c814c2fb9465ab</id><updated>2026-09-08T12:55:40Z</updated><published>2026-08-29T07:20:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/this-extremely-successful-author-polarizes-german-readers/a-78500452--1ca180b39c00.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/this-extremely-successful-author-polarizes-german-readers/a-78500452?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">She's young and she says what she thinks: Caroline Wahl is topping Germany's bestseller lists with her novels. But she has also faced a public backlash.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Germany's military wants to recruit tech-savvy gamers</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:92c2db82dae4a4580ce0ad6671f3326ef7b9f59bff909dbcfa0c52487272de87</id><updated>2026-09-08T12:55:40Z</updated><published>2026-08-28T10:03:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-s-military-wants-to-recruit-tech-savvy-gamers/a-78536462--a4ab0409cda1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-s-military-wants-to-recruit-tech-savvy-gamers/a-78536462?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Bundeswehr has been a fixture at Gamescom, Cologne's video game trade fair, for years. But critics say military recruitment does not belong at an entertainment convention.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry></feed>
